  displayText: 'CBT Wizard


    Sigurd''s danger level: 80%


    Scientific name:
    Testiculus Wizardus


    Description - A Mall Wizard born with a really rare
    mutation allowing it to use magic and cast spells. They like to roam with their
    more common counterpart, acting as cult leaders.


    Although this species
    seems to only know one single spell, be really careful of its deadly nature as
    many researchers have died of blunt scrotal trauma trying to study this species.


    It
    also seems that with time, their magic imbued their sapphire casted wand with
    time. I should try to gather one and try it for myself. - Sigurd'
